cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyLuminescence, please cite it using the metadata below. It is a
  Python port of the R package 'Luminescence'; please also cite the R package
  and its publications as listed under references.
type: software
title: "PyLuminescence: Luminescence dating data analysis in Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python port of the R package 'Luminescence' for luminescence dating data
  analysis, validated against the current CRAN release of the R package.
